  "initialFailures": [
    "The immunity fixture initially applied immunity to the caster instead of the target; corrected applyTo and retained the negative event checks.",
    "The defense comparison initially included the enemy Eris opener only in its baseline; consumed that actual opener before comparing ordinary damage.",
    "An endpoint assertion incorrectly expected phasing through friendly/dead bodies. Probes confirmed ordinary soft body separation changes travelled distance while the dash budget expires without contact; retained existing collision rules and asserted the actual reason for stopping.",
    "The schema positive control omitted the required damage amount; restored a valid pre-damage hook before checking the new incompatible settled-damage filter.",
    "Typecheck caught remaining-distance access on a leap union; narrowed to a ground dash.",
    "Review found zero-direction input could reuse an existing dash object. Guarded new override identity and added a runtime regression."
  ],
